<html style="overflow-y: hidden;">
<head>
	<style>
	.footerText{
		line-height: 14px; 
		padding-top: 10px;
		text-align: left;
	}
        
	</style>
</head>
<body>
    <table class="body" style="background: #f3f3f3;width: 100%;border-spacing: 0;">
        <tbody>
            <tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
                <td align="center" valign="top" style="padding: 0px;">
                    <table bgcolor="#f3f3f3" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="650">
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top" width="718">
                                   <table bgcolor="#ffffff" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%">
                                        <tbody style="background: #0071c5;  color: white;">
                                            <tr>
                                                <td valign="top">
													<div style="padding-top: 2rem;    padding-bottom: 2rem;    text-align: center;">
														
														<span><img src='https://img03.en25.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{1a814392-3a10-434c-bdb3-175cc3fbfa07}_intel-logo-white_UPDATED.png'/></span>
													</div>
                                                </td>
												
                                            </tr>
                                        </tbody>
                                    </table>
                                    <div style="padding-left: 1rem; padding-right: 1rem; background: #fff; margin-top: 0.5rem; line-height: 20px; color: #555554; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
                                        <p style=" margin-top: 0; padding-top: 1rem;">
                                            <span style="font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400;color: #0071c5;"> {!Contact.FirstName},</span>
                                        </p>
                                        <p style="margin-top: 10px;">
                                            <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400">O administrador da sua empresa ou um representante Intel o adicionou à conta {{ACCOUNTNAME}} do programa de parceiros Intel. Para ativar sua conta e começar a aproveitar seus benefícios, confirme suas informações e complete a seção de requisitos legais.

													<br/>
													<br/>Salve suas informações de logon para referência futura:

												</span>
                                        </p>
                                        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400">
                                            <li>
                                                <b>Nome de usuário : </b> {!Contact.Core_Login_Id__c}

                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <b>Endereço de e-mail : </b> {!Contact.Email}

                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <b>Nome da empresa :</b> {{ACCOUNTNAME}}

                                            </li>
                                        </ul>
                                        <p style="margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                            <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400">Sua senha deve ser protegida como confidencial. O uso desta senha nos websites da Intel é regido pelos Termos de Uso da Intel contidos nos links posicionados na parte inferior de cada página da web do respectivo site.</span>
                                        </p>
                                        <span class="btnCompleteNow" style="background-color: #00aeef !important; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 5px 20px; border-radius: 3px; border: currentColor;  height: 2rem; border:0;">
											
										<a href="{{EVLINK}}" style="text-decoration: none;color: #fefefe; font-size: 18px;">PREENCHER AGORA</a>
										</span>
												
                                        <p style="margin-top: 10px;">
                                            <span style="font-size: 12px;">Perguntas? Para obter suporte, clique <a href="{{SUPPORTLINK}}">aqui</a>.
											</span>

                                        </p>
                                        &nbsp;

                                    </div>
                                    <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #003c71; min-width: 670px; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
                                        <tbody>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 30px; padding-bottom: 20px; padding-top: 10px;">
                                                    <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                                                        <tbody style="color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10px;">
                                                            <tr>
                                                                <td class="footerText" valign="top">Copyright &copy; 2020 Intel Corporation.</td>
                                                            </tr>
                                                            <tr>
                                                                <td class="footerText" valign="top">Intel Corporation, 2200 Mission College Blvd., M/S RNB4-145, Santa Clara, CA 95054 USA.

                                                                    <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/br/pt/homepage.html" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank">Intel.com</a>
                                                                </td>
                                                            </tr>
                                                            <tr>
                                                                <td style="padding-top: 10px;; line-height: 14px; text-align: left;" valign="top">
                                                                    <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/br/pt/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;">Privacidade</a> |

                                                                    <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/br/pt/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;">Cookies</a> |

                                                                    <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/br/pt/legal/trademarks.html" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;">*Marcas comerciais</a> |

                                                                    <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/br/pt/my-intel/subscription-center.html" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;">Cancelar inscrição</a>
																	
                                                                </td>
                                                            </tr>
                                                        </tbody>
                                                    </table>
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </tbody>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</body>
</html>